--- OVERVIEW: cp2k_MD ---

Reference CP2K (DFT-MD) calculations on the PPiMg2 (2Mg2+[P2O7]4-) system, predating/
alongside the DeePMD-kit NNP pipelines elsewhere in this tree -- used to generate/validate
starting configurations and check the reaction-coordinate definitions later reused by the NNP
+PLUMED LFER work (see ../LFER/LFER_3_mg2/ppimg2/README).

o configuration/   three starting-geometry variants (full system, 'edges', 'sides' framings
                    of the reaction coordinate) -- see configuration/README.
o PPiMg2_sides.xyz / PPiMg2_edges.xyz: loose root-level copies of two of those geometries.
o PPiMg2_sides/    CP2K NVT MD run from the 'sides' geometry -- see PPiMg2_sides/README.
o CP2K_opt_SMD/    CP2K steered-MD run driving the reaction directly -- see
                    CP2K_opt_SMD/README (and CP2K_opt_SMD/initial/README for the detailed,
                    already-documented work log).

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
